{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31132","headline":"行次灵龛驿寄西蜀尚书 · 薛能","name":"行次灵龛驿寄西蜀尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北客推车指蜀门，乾阳知已近临坤。\n从辞府郭常回首，欲别封疆更感恩。\n援寡圣朝难望阙，暑催蚕麦得归村。\n雷公解斸冲天气，白日何辜遣戴盆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}